    "steps": [
      "\\Delta f(x)=f(x+1)-f(x),\\qquad \\Delta^{4}f(0)=\\sum_{k=0}^{4}(-1)^{4-k}\\binom{4}k f(k)",
      "f(x)=x^{4},\\qquad\\Delta(x^d)=d x^{d-1}+\\textnormal{terms of lower degree}",
      "\\textnormal{Each difference lowers the degree by one and multiplies the leading coefficient by the old degree. After the required number of differences only a constant remains.}",
      "\\Delta^{4}x^{4}=4!=24",
      "24"
    ]
  },
